MSG_CLI_REPAIR_WARNING
REPAIR writes to %s: on %s. It only does so when the result passes the check,\nand the old blocks are saved to the undo file first - but a damaged disk is a\ndamaged disk. If the data matters, run RESCUE first.\n
;
MSG_CLI_UNDO_WARNING
UNDO writes saved blocks back to %s: from %s.\n
;
MSG_CLI_MORE_LINES
... and %lu more of that kind (ALL shows every line).\n
